  solution: "1) Nh\u1EB7t th\xF9ng \u1EDF G3 (l\xE0n g\u1EA7n, E).\n2) \u0110\u1ED5i
    sang l\xE0n xa (W), \u0111\u1EE9ng \u1EDF G5,6 v\xE0 \u0111\u1EB7t th\xF9ng (E)
    l\xEAn b\xE0n \u0111\u1EA1p t\u1EA3i G6 \u2014 c\u1EA7u n\xE2ng h\u1EA1 xu\u1ED1ng.\n3)
    V\u1EC1 l\xE0n g\u1EA7n (S), \u0111i qua c\u1EA7u G10\u2013G14. L\xE0n xa b\u1ECB
    container ch\u1EB7n t\u1EDBi G11,5.\n4) N\u1EBFu NH\u1ECAP \u0111\xE3 l\xEAn
    b\u1EADc 2 (v\xF2ng \u0111\u1ECF \u1EDF G12,5): qua kh\u1ECFi G11,6 th\xEC \u0111\u1ED5i
    sang l\xE0n c\xF2n l\u1EA1i \u0111\u1EC3 n\xE9 m\xF3c c\u1EA9u.\n5) T\u1EDBi
    th\xF9ng th\u01B0 G16."
